SUMMARY:26th World Congress of Psychiatry (WCP 2026)
DESCRIPTION:The 26th World Congress of Psychiatry is organized by the Wor
 ld Psychiatric Association together with the Swedish Psychiatric Associa
 tion under the theme Guided by Compassion\, Grounded in Science: Psychia
 try for Our Time. The programme covers clinical\, research and policy to
 pics across psychiatry.\n\nDeadlines\nSession proposal submission: 2026-
 02-09\nFellowship applications: 2026-03-19\nAbstract submission: 2026-03
 -23\nEarly registration: 2026-06-02\nRegular registration: 2026-08-18\n\
 nhttps://wcp-congress.com/
LOCATION:Stockholm\, Stockholm County\, SE\, Stockholmsmässan
URL:https://wcp-congress.com/
